{
  "_comment": "개편 3차 + WP-16/WP-22: 클래스별 베이스 스킬 + 숲 확장 + 템포 스킬 + 콘텐츠 A 12종. damage_type(physical/magical)과 rune_sockets(PoE 소켓)가 추가되었다. 태그는 룬 장착 조건(정본 §3.2)의 입력이며 수치는 잠정값이다. WP-16 템포 스킬 4종(shove/barrage/shackle/imp_firebomb) 추가. WP-22: skills rows are the full authored set — the equip pool lives in units.json `skills`; default loadout = first 4 of that pool (BuildLoadout). Role axes — hook: drags a range-2 enemy next to the warrior | bash: melee hit that weakens the target's damage | charge: long line hit that knocks every struck enemy back | brace: spend a leftover AP to buff yourself | mark: cheap ranged weaken | pin: ranged move-lock (delay an advance) | piercing: line hit through several enemies at range | storm: ranged area denial | frost_lance: ranged freeze control | flame_field: area burn (zone strengthening) | renew: 1-AP tempo heal | static: cheap paralysis gamble. Shared IDs use forest display names; original Ember names: Strike, Cleave, Arrow, Volley, Bolt, Weakening fog, Heal, Battle blessing, Curse.",
